{"sections":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SpriteKit으로 작은 2D 퍼즐을 먼저 만들고, GameStore로 상태와 규칙을 분리한 뒤, 나중에 SceneKit 큐브로 확장하는 한국어 튜토리얼입니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"정규 트랙은 1-10장입니다. 약 110분 안에 2D SpriteKit 퍼즐을 만들고, 그 화면을 SceneKit 큐브 한 면에 붙인 뒤, 큐브 표면 터치를 한붓그리기 선택으로 연결합니다."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"action":{"isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","overridingTitle":"Get started","type":"reference"},"kind":"hero","title":"큐브 한붓그리기 퍼즐"},{"image":null,"content":[],"kind":"volume","name":null,"chapters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI 안에 SpriteKit scene을 올리고, layer와 tile, touch 흐름을 작은 화면에서 익힙니다."}]}],"tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/02-SpriteKit-Tiles-And-Touch-Names","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/03-Foundation-Board-Model-And-TileID","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/04-Foundation-GameStore-And-Neighbor-Rule"],"name":"정규 트랙 A: SpriteKit 첫 화면","image":"chapter-spritekit.svg"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tile 선택 상태를 저장하고, 2x2 board 규칙을 만든 뒤, SpriteKit face를 SceneKit 큐브에 붙이고, 큐브 표면 터치를 한붓그리기 선택으로 연결합니다."}]}],"tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/05-SwiftUI-StateObject-And-Scene-Connection","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/06-SwiftUI-Undo-And-Three-By-Three","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/07-SceneKit-Cube-Material-And-T